  "details": "Currently I'm Gheist Winters on VRChat and have been wanting to look into updating to a new display name that better works with the current persona and identity that I've been trying to comfortably situate myself in. But the name I want to use it over the limit of 15.\n\nBy 3 letters.\n\nSo I want to offer the idea of getting people to try and change this. I'm sure there's other users who'd also want to be able to fit a name in this limit. That way folks who're feeling a bit down about having to think of a new name that's supposed to fit into the limit can have a bit more room to work with.",
